<title>UK: Australian/N.Z. wool prices for December.</title>
<headline>Australian/N.Z. wool prices for December.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commonwealth Secretariat estimated Australian and New Zealand wool prices for December as follows, in pence per kilo clean, cif UK dry-combed.</p>
<p>   70s 399	  64s 330	  60s 282	  58s 268</p>
<p>   56s 251	  50s 228	  48s 217	  46s 210</p>
<p>Prices are based on quotations from sales in Australia and New Zealand and represent unweighted average for super, good and average fleeces and skirting (free and light burry). Quotes for 56s and coarser are confined to New Zealand wools.</p>
</text>
